# Real personal Google Pay statements (Phase 7/15, testing/edge-case-matching
# branch): both contain the same real phone number, email, and counterparty
# names - despite the "mock/" directory name, mock/gpay_statement_20260101_20260630.pdf
# is NOT synthetic either (confirmed by extracting its text during Phase 15's
# privacy review; it's been tracked since the wave1 commit). Both are
# untracked going forward (git rm --cached) but kept on disk locally for
# tests that use them - see evaluation/test_edge_cases.py and
# evaluation/test_pdf_ingestion_hardening.py, which skip those tests
# gracefully when the files aren't present (e.g. in a fresh CI checkout).
